# Audited vulnerability exceptions (scripts/vulncheck.sh). CI fails on any
# CALLED vulnerability that is not listed here; every entry MUST carry a
# reason and a revisit condition, and should be removed the moment the
# toolchain or dependency moves.
#
# Format: the GO-XXXX-NNNN id must start the line, followed by a space or tab
# and the reason. A colon right after the id ("GO-...: reason") or leading
# spaces do NOT match and the gate still blocks. Lines starting with '#' are
# comments.
